summary: Check that kmemleak is working
description: |
    Kmemleak provides a way of detecting possible kernel memory leaks in a way similar to a tracing garbage collector,
    with the difference that the orphan objects are not freed but only reported via /sys/kernel/debug/kmemleak.
    Author: Chunyu Hu <chuhu@redhat.com>
contact: Chunyu Hu <chuhu@redhat.com>
component:
  - kernel-debug
test: bash ./runtest.sh
framework: beakerlib
duration: 1h
extra-summary: memory/function/kmemleak
extra-task: memory/function/kmemleak

# ---------------------
# Filter definitions   |
# ---------------------

tag:
  - VMM_FUNCTION
